{"seq":2,"slug":"worldly-wisdom","title":"Worldly Wisdom","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/worldly-wisdom","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"diligence-and-prudence","title":"勤与谦","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/worldly-wisdom/diligence-and-prudence","wordCount":1931,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"steadiness-and-endurance","title":"结硬寨打呆仗","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/worldly-wisdom/steadiness-and-endurance","wordCount":2084,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现曾国藩的处世智慧。&quot;勤&quot;与&quot;谦&quot;——以勤成事、以谦保身（&quot;满招损，谦受益&quot;）——是他立身、处世、保家的根本。而&quot;结硬寨，打呆仗&quot;——稳扎稳打、以拙胜巧、行稳致远——则体现了他&quot;尚拙&quot;、稳健、坚韧的独特智慧。这些智慧，对当代浮躁、急功近利的风气，是一种宝贵的针砭。本章揭示曾国藩稳健、务实的处世智慧。</p>\n"}